{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>The Gallery</strong>, a mysterious and immersive <strong>first-person puzzle game</strong> where every painting holds a secret. Explore a beautifully crafted art gallery filled with intricate riddles that challenge your perception, logic, and attention to detail. Each room presents a unique puzzle inspired by the artwork itself\u2014decipher hidden numbers, rearrange paintings, and uncover patterns to unlock the next exhibit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddbc <strong>Art-Inspired Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Solve challenges based on paintings, from counting ravens to identifying historical space missions.<br>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Observation-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Study every detail, uncover hidden clues, and connect the dots to progress.<br>\ud83c\udfdb <strong>A Mysterious Gallery</strong> \u2013 Wander through an ever-changing museum filled with striking and thought-provoking exhibits.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>First-Person Exploration</strong> \u2013 Experience the game at your own pace with smooth, immersive movement.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong> \u2013 Subtle environmental sounds and cryptic audio hints enhance the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every painting tells a story. <strong>Will you uncover the secrets hidden within <i>The Gallery</i>?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529330?t=1741035028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529330?t=1741035028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529330/705144ed3a58d8ecf15de1a07671ec245ae4f228/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741035028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529330/705144ed3a58d8ecf15de1a07671ec245ae4f228/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741035028","categ